# Env / secrets
.env
*.local.properties
# Pre-existing local secret file at repo root - migrated to the
# ConfigLoader env-var-override mechanism (see EnvConfig/ConfigLoader).
# Kept ignored as a belt-and-suspenders measure even though it has never
# been committed.
APIKey.txt

# Claude Code local settings - the harness may record literal command
# strings (including secrets passed via env vars on the command line,
# e.g. SONAR_TOKEN) into its local permission-allow list. Never commit.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude
docs